<b>s o   I ' m   N o t   G i v i n g   U p</b>

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.110
Future

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.120
I've had enough.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.510
I'm done with you two.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:24.220
I never want to see you again!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:28.970
Even then...

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:30.100
Even then...

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.030
Even then...

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.110
Even then...

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.940
We...

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.410
The dish is the vessel of life.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:43.910
If it has form, it will 
someday break and be lost.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:48.170
What the boys saw was 
