necessarily a bright one.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:10.210
Hope and despair are both one with life.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:19.950
It's the Little Prince and Little Princess!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:24.960
Never forget that only those who connect 
