00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:30.460
can take the future in their hands.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:32.340
<i>I get it.</i>

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.590
<i>It's my choice.</i>

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.350
<i>I'm going to believe in what I choose.</i>

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:45.010
<i>It's because I have people I care 
about that I get sad and happy.</i>

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:49.940
