00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:48.920
<i>Please</i>

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:54.290
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:17:55.070 --> 00:18:00.020
<i>Even if you aren't here now</i>

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:05.650
<i>Please give me the courage to reach out</i>

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.420
<i>Stand by you</i>

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.380
<i>Please</i>

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:16.790
<i>I want to get rid of everything</i>

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:22.250
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:29.490
