00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.750
<b>Morinaka Juvenile Detention Center</b>

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.750
<b>3 Years Later</b>

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.750
Never come back here, you hear?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.060
