00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:00.450
<i>This world is filled with connections.</i>

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:06.930
<i>Connections of blood, connections of
the city, connections of wishes...</i>

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.450
<i>Lucky to be a frog!</i>

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:14.130
<b>Asakusa Quecrotte</b>

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:12.770
<i>So glad I'm a frog!</i>

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.130
<i>Asakusa Quecrotte!</i>

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:17.140
<b>Azumabashi</b>

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.140
<i>Everyone's connected in this world.</i>

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:24.140
<i>But everything in my life is done.</i>

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.450
<i>What's lost is never coming back.</i>

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:38.400
And what's wrong with that?

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:38.400
<b>Azumabashi</b>

00:19:54.080 --> 00:20:03.020
<i>There's something I have to take back</i>

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.090
