00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.550
Why are you here?

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:29.700
I'm sick of seeing you two.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.090
<i>Sing for tomorrow</i>

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.010
<i>Make a miracle happen</i>

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:46.720
<i>That's what connects you to the future</i>

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.720
<i>Soul on a dish, stack your plates</i>

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.220
Next

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.980
