Sarazanmai!

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.950
<b>I   W a n t   t o   C o n n e c t,</b>

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.950
<b>s o   S a r a z a n m a i</b>

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:26.430
<i>Once the background blends together,
